<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96402" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέγος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέγος</span>,
			prop.<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roof</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ep.Je.</u>
				10
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέγους</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				19.45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).1114.14
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Geronthrae</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				11.162
			</span></i>, and so perh. in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				48
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸ αὐτὸ ς.
			ἐλθεῖν</span> 'under the same <i>roof'</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1179.20
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cnidus</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέγη</span>
			, <i>house, mansion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				141
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ag.</u>
				310
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				307
			</span></i>, etc.; prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				619.5
			</span></i> (Syria, <span class="entity">iv A.D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέξαι μ᾽ ἐς τὸ σὸν ς</span>., i.e. into
				<i>the urn</i> containing his ashes, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				1165
			</span></i>; <i>grave</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				1098
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>brothel</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεγέεσσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					2.430
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.533
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
